---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="Privacy Policy of Rozgar Raasta Pakistan — what data we collect, how we use it, and your rights.">
	<section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12">
		<h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl">Privacy Policy</h1>
		<p class="mt-3 text-sm text-muted">Last updated: 26 November 2026</p>
		<div class="prose-rrp mt-6">
			<h2>What we collect</h2>
			<p>Rozgar Raasta Pakistan is a public information website. We do not require you to create an account to read articles or browse opportunities.</p>
			<ul>
				<li><strong>Newsletter:</strong> if you subscribe, we store your email address in your own browser (local storage) for now. When a newsletter service is connected, your email will be used only to send the weekly newsletter. You can unsubscribe at any time.</li>
				<li><strong>Contact form:</strong> messages you send open your email app; we do not store form submissions on our servers.</li>
				<li><strong>CV Builder:</strong> everything you type stays in your browser. We do not upload, store or share it.</li>
				<li><strong>Analytics:</strong> when connected, we use privacy-conscious analytics to understand which pages are popular. We do not sell analytics data.</li>
			</ul>
			<h2>What we never collect</h2>
			<p>We never ask for your CNIC, bank account details, passwords or any payment information. If anyone contacts you claiming to be us and asks for these, it is a scam — do not share them.</p>
			<h2>Cookies</h2>
			<p>This site uses only essential, functional storage (for example, remembering a newsletter subscription in your browser). We do not use tracking cookies for advertising without clear consent.</p>
			<h2>Third-party links</h2>
			<p>Our pages link to official government, education and platform websites. Their privacy practices are their own; please read their policies before sharing information with them.</p>
			<h2>Advertising</h2>
			<p>We plan to use Google AdSense. Google may use cookies to serve ads based on your visits to this and other sites. You can opt out of personalised advertising in your Google Ads settings.</p>
			<h2>Your rights</h2>
			<p>You can ask us to delete any personal information you have shared with us by email. Contact us through the <a href="/contact">Contact page</a>.</p>
			<h2>Changes</h2>
			<p>If this policy changes, we will update the date above and note the change here.</p>
		</div>
	</section>
</BaseLayout>
